Chapter: DeepRecursionRt

 The probe from docs/Designs/Active/Compiler/PlugDeepRecursion.md, depths
 raised to one million: self tail, mutual tail, and genuinely non-tail. A
 browser fixes its wasm stack near one megabyte and no flag reaches it, so
 mutual tail recursion must run in constant stack or the target cannot carry
 the compiler. The non-tail row stays at a depth every target's default
 survives, because a non-tail frame is a real obligation no emitter can
 discharge.

  down : Integer -> Integer
  down (n) = if n <= 0 then 0 else down (n - 1)

  ping : Integer -> Integer
  ping (n) = if n <= 0 then 0 else pong (n - 1)

  pong : Integer -> Integer
  pong (n) = if n <= 0 then 1 else ping (n - 1)

  sum-to : Integer -> Integer
  sum-to (n) = if n <= 0 then 0 else n + sum-to (n - 1)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
   print-line-uni (show (down 1000000))
   print-line-uni (show (ping 1000000))
   print-line-uni (show (pong 1000000))
   print-line-uni (show (sum-to 1000))
   print-line-uni (show (sum-to 10000))
  end
